<div class="section section--page-width pq-collection-intro">
  <h1>{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' and collection.handle == 'electric-dirt-bikes' %}Electric Dirt Bikes for Adults{% else %}{{ collection.title | escape }}{% endif %}</h1>
  <div class="rte">{% if request.locale.iso_code == 'en' and collection.handle == 'electric-dirt-bikes' %}<p>Panquire’s T-01 and T-02 are electric dirt bikes for adult off-road riders. Choose the lighter 60V T-01 for recreational trails, or the 72V T-02 for more peak power and battery capacity. Both use removable batteries and three selectable power levels.</p>{% elsif request.locale.iso_code == 'en' and collection.handle == 'electric-motorcycles' %}<p>Explore the Panquire T-03, a mini electric motorcycle with 12-inch Kenda road tires and a removable 60V battery. Review fit, charging information and local vehicle-use requirements before choosing a model.</p>{% else %}{{ collection.description }}{% endif %}</div>
</div>
{% stylesheet %}
  .pq-collection-intro { padding-block: 48px; }
  .pq-collection-intro h1 { margin-block: 0 12px; }
{% endstylesheet %}
